            </ul>
            <p>Customer shall notify Provider in writing within ten (10) business days of any change to the information required under this Section 14.3. Accurate physical address information under this Section is also relied upon for NG911/E911 Registered Location purposes under Section 2.3, so stale or inaccurate contact information is a concern beyond ordinary account administration.</p>

